---
type: llm
weight: 1
---

PASS only if all of the following hold, else FAIL:
1. Runs or describes the setup check (loads the config, `cryoet_have m`) and recognises M is not configured.
2. Stops cleanly: tells the user Warp 2.0 (MTools/MCore) must be installed and WARP_ENV_SCRIPT set via the cryoet-workflow setup; does not search the filesystem for a Warp build or guess a path.
3. Submits no job and writes no job script with a hardcoded MCore path.
